          <change when="2013-11-19T13:01:59.125-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/joshuad.sosin">Vote - AcceptText - Accept. Lin4 Θεωγ omega is quite clear on digital image: http://quod.lib.umich.edu/a/apis/x-1370/1285R_2.TIF ; at lin16 I think I can see kappa, but it, and the following xi, is fuzzy. The digital image is blurry. Suggest Verhoogt look at the original.</change>
          <change when="2013-11-15T14:44:02.414-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/m.zellmann-rohrer">line 5: Θεογονίδα → Θεωγονίδα (l. Θεογονίδα) based on digital image (Michigan APIS). Omega seems clear&#xD;
